WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
Not every learning asset belongs only inside the course player.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.900
Job aids, checklists, worksheets, quick reference guides, policy summaries, lab guides,

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.240
and printable handouts can support learners after the course is complete.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.475
These resources are especially valuable when the real task happens later,

00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:17.220
under time pressure, or away from the training environment.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.770
Tools such as InDesign, Acrobat,

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:23.030
or similar document-production tools can support polished downloadable resources at a high

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:23.460
level.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.520
The design should prioritize usability.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.535
A job aid should be easy to scan, easy to print when needed, and easy to update.

00:00:29.535 --> 00:00:32.715
It should not be a decorative brochure if the learner needs a working reference.

00:00:32.715 --> 00:00:34.455
Accessible document design matters.

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:38.340
Use meaningful headings, readable text, logical structure, sufficient contrast,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.980
descriptive links, and alternative text planning for meaningful images.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.360
If a PDF is distributed,

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.920
the team should consider whether it can be navigated and understood by learners using

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.180
assistive technology.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.200
Accessibility is part of the asset, not an optional afterthought.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.195
Versioning is important for downloadable resources because learners may save copies.

00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:57.920
Include a clear title, date or version where appropriate,

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.640
and ownership information if the organization uses it.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.920
Keep source files and export files organized so updates can be made without rebuilding the

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.155
entire course from scratch.

00:01:06.155 --> 00:01:08.760
Align job aids with real workplace tasks.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.075
A good checklist supports a decision or action.

00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:13.240
A worksheet helps learners apply a process.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.595
A quick reference guide helps them remember steps without replaying a module.

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:21.725
Downloadable resources are most valuable when they extend the course into the learner

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:21.840
actual work environment.
